        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9029P, Maddox Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Maddox Square Grip Door Pull is one of Omnia Hardware's newest modern additions to their door handle collection. This modern square door pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch lengths in a wide array of contemporary finish colors. The Maddox Pull features a square design that will add modern appeal to your front door. This Omnia Ultima III 9029P Door Pull is thru-bolt mounted--pull bolts all the way through the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima II 9029P Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9029P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9029P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9029P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/maddox-door-pull-back-to-back-pair-omnia-btb-9029p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
